Huge monsters will work, but the "right" small monster will too if you
get enough of them. The wrong monster will not appease your god, but
the right one will appease him to a lesser extent than a huge one.
See the tables in
http://www.nethack.de/spoiler/appeasement.txt. There is one list if
your god is chaotic, and a different one if he is lawful or neutral.

"Feeling of inadequacy" means that this monster isn't on the list for
your alignment.  "Partially mollified" means that it was on the list,
but you need to keep going.

Nurses are indeed on both lists, so the OP's original plan would work.


